title: What stands behind the procedure is four notes, each one request away.
pid: 3400e8dd-d208-4d9c-a609-8d3d28cb1ab6
body: |2-
  Nothing contains them, so that waking does not draw them: view one
  by its ID when the work needs it.
  - [[id:1d4b3934-5e6f-40c4-8bf6-2fd3e9b837b6][the reasons and particulars of each step]], one child per step.
  - [[id:b034bd82-6ed1-48cb-81d5-d492db9209b3][what I read, and what I took from each]]: the sources on planning,
    then those on reviewing code and on working together. A new
    source goes there, under its group.
  - [[id:7c1c9b52-05d2-4d67-8891-b1f937b06b39][where the procedure departs from its sources]], because of how
    this team is shaped.
  - [[id:0b103101-28e3-4380-8d26-e95a34f18dd5][what I am unsure of, and the smallest trial that would tell]]. When
    Top reports how a use of the procedure went, look here first for
    the doubt it settles.
